    {
      "text": "hath given him authority to execute judgment, John 5:27. if I judge, my judgment is true, John 8:16. For judgment I am come into this world, John 9:39. ordained of God to be the Judge of quick and dead, Acts 10:42 (2 Tim. 4:1; 1 Pet. 4:5; Moro. 10:34). God shall judge the secrets of men by Jesus Christ, Rom. 2:16. all stand before the judgment seat of Christ, Rom. 14:10 (2 Cor. 5:10; 2 Ne. 28:23; Mosiah 16:10; Alma 12:12; Morm. 3:20; 7:6; Ether 12:38; Moro. 8:21; D&C 135:5). he that judgeth me is the Lord, 1 Cor. 4:4. Lord, the righteous judge, 2 Tim. 4:8. God the Judge of all, Heb. 12:23. whoremongers and adulterers God will judge, Heb. 13:4. To execute judgment upon all, Jude 1:15 (1 Ne. 22:21). Lord … thou hast judged thus, Rev. 16:5. strong is the Lord God who judgeth her, Rev. 18:8. true and righteous are his judgments, Rev. 19:2.",
